<section id="S3.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">3.3 </span>Evaluation Metrics</h3>

<div id="S3.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Performance on each game is assessed with complementary metrics (Table <a href="#S3.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ 3.3 Evaluation Metrics ‣ 3 Games in EvoEmpirBench ‣ EvoEmpirBench: Dynamic Spatial Reasoning with Agent-ExpVer" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>), reflecting both general task success and environment-specific skills. Key metrics include <span id="S3.SS3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Suc.Rate</span> (Success Rate) and <span id="S3.SS3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">A.Score</span> (Average Score). For the maze environment, additional metrics capture navigation efficiency and survival capabilities: <span id="S3.SS3.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">A.steps</span> (Average Steps), <span id="S3.SS3.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">A.Explor</span> (Average Exploration), <span id="S3.SS3.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">A.Gold</span> (Average Gold Collected), <span id="S3.SS3.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Rem.HP</span> (Remaining HP), <span id="S3.SS3.p1.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">A.kills</span> (Average Enemy Kills), and <span id="S3.SS3.p1.1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">A.Barr</span> (Average Barriers Destroyed). In match-2, metrics emphasize step efficiency and API optimization: <span id="S3.SS3.p1.1.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">R/M.S</span> (Remaining/Max Steps Ratio), <span id="S3.SS3.p1.1.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Score/Step</span>, <span id="S3.SS3.p1.1.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Clear/Step</span>, and <span id="S3.SS3.p1.1.12" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">API Eff.</span> (API Efficiency). These metrics provides a thorough evaluation of agent capabilities across distinct task requirements.</p>
</div>
