<div id="Ax4.SSx2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax4.SSx2.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax4.SSx2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Action:</span> <span id="Ax4.SSx2.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">eliminate at (0,3)</span></p>
